  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-账户、客户与资质\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以按照一定方式上传符合格式的客户投放资质、主体资质相关图片，例如营业执照等。此接口上传的是资质图片，如需上传素材图片请调用【上传营销图片】接口。\",\"id\":\"ad.image.upload\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/image/advertiser/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710599659532\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.image.upload_marketing\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710600176640\",\"reason\":\"此接口上传资质图片，如需上传素材图片需调用该接口\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"上传营销图片\"},{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该接口文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"此接口应答的返回码和返回信息详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"参考文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710599659532\",\"title\":\"上传资质图片\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i3jR3S7d\">通过此接口，用户可以按照一定方式上传符合格式的客户<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">投放资质、主体资质相关图片</span>，例如营业执照等，接口会返回\"code_0\"和\"message_OK\"，代表上传成功<span style=\"color: #eb1010;\"></span></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-o4ddNOc3\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TF2Jy8PW\">图片格式：jpg、jpeg、png、bmp、gif，大小2M内</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-6Z27D5iA%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopenapi%2Fdoc%2Findex.html%3Fid%3D1696710600176640%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%90%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E3%80%91%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22grYe5%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-xApNT2f0%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22background-color%3A%20%23fff5eb%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22background-color%3A%20%23fff5eb%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22background-color%3A%20%23fff5eb%3B%5C%22%3E%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%3C%2Fspan%3E%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Fla